---
description: Request only the missing right from its responsible rights holder or authorized contact.
args: { dossier: RightsDossier; compatibility: UseCompatibility[] }
returns: ClearanceTask[]
---
For every missing right, identify the item, proposed use, channel, duration and responsible rights holder. Keep donor ownership separate from reproduction rights. Preserve unanswered clearance requests as pending; do not treat silence as a grant.
